  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to Flood-Stricken Populations in Benin - Start Alert 662</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an emergency project implemented in 3 flood-affected Communes in Ou&#xE9;m&#xE9; Department, Benin: Dangbo, Adjohoun and Bonou. Activities include multi-purpose cash grants to 1481 households; psychological support and child protection support to affected girls and boys, and training and sensitisations to child protection committees on CPiE and GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
